<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>chinatown!</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">22december</ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2">Shady Moon</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">chinatown!</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4JipCNXiKHe9LiKqMQr5w7</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.830" end="00:19.730">Bad bitch and she from Chinatown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.730" end="00:21.950">Hop in the whip, skrrt off fast, dodgin' rounds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.950" end="00:23.500">Smokin' on gas and I be servin' all the pounds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.500" end="00:26.010">Catch me sippin' on Henny, another .40 goin' down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.010" end="00:28.340">Like strapped up, always got my chopstick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.340" end="00:30.000">Thots call me super, but I don't need a sidekick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.000" end="00:32.440">'Less that sidekicks yo bitch, shawty suckin' on my dick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.440" end="00:35.320">Got my finger on the trigger, you ain't even hear the click</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.320" end="00:37.170">Bad bitch and she from Chinatown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.170" end="00:39.010">Hop in the whip, skrrt off fast, dodgin' rounds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.010" end="00:41.230">Smokin' on gas and I be servin' all the pounds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.230" end="00:43.620">Catch me sippin' on Henny, another .40 goin' down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.620" end="00:45.730">Like strapped up, always got my chopstick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.730" end="00:47.910">Thots call me super, but I don't need a sidekick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.910" end="00:49.740">'Less that sidekicks yo bitch, shawty suckin' on my dick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.740" end="00:52.080">Got my finger on the trigger, you ain't even hear the click</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.080" end="00:54.200">I'm going apeshit, twenty-two shots, no December</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.200" end="00:56.480">I'ma empty the clip, this fam gon' lose another member</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.480" end="00:58.880">I be smokin on Za', I know my ass won't remember</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.880" end="01:00.750">These bitches wanna fuck, I'm a D1 defender</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.750" end="01:03.140">I don't fuck wit' thе thot hoes, you move differеnt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.140" end="01:05.290">Fucked on bitches, they breaking up 'cause she limping</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.290" end="01:07.250">She wanna get busy, I told that bitch I'm not simping</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.250" end="01:09.820">MCM belt around my waist what the fuck is she trippin' for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.820" end="01:12.100">Just bagged a bitch, swear you know were she from</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.100" end="01:14.150">Chinatown, said that once, you bitches dumb?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.150" end="01:16.320">Haha I fuck yo' main just for fun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.320" end="01:18.720">I really ain't shit, I got her staring at the sun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.720" end="01:20.640">Pulling pedals, she saying did he love me or not?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.640" end="01:22.880">Dumbass bitch, I ain't tripping over any thot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.880" end="01:25.040">Me and 22 gon' knock you over with the Glock</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.040" end="01:27.580">Fans and deagles, your time is running off the clock like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.580" end="01:29.340">Bad bitch and she from Chinatown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.340" end="01:31.750">Hop in the whip, skrrt off fast, dodgin' rounds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.750" end="01:33.690">Smokin' on gas and I be servin' all the pounds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.690" end="01:36.300">Catch me sippin' on Henny, another .40 goin' down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.300" end="01:38.260">Like strapped up, always got my chopstick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.260" end="01:40.240">Thots call me super, but I don't need a sidekick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.240" end="01:42.410">'Less that sidekicks yo bitch, shawty suckin' on my dick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.410" end="01:45.030">Got my finger on the trigger, you ain't even hear the click</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.030" end="01:46.860">Bad bitch and she from Chinatown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.860" end="01:49.250">Hop in the whip, skrrt off fast, dodgin' rounds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.250" end="01:51.060">Smokin' on gas and I be servin' all the pounds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.060" end="01:53.300">Catch me sippin' on Henny, another .40 goin' down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.300" end="01:55.460">Like strapped up, always got my chopstick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.460" end="01:57.510">Thots call me super, but I don't need a sidekick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.510" end="01:59.690">'Less that sidekicks yo bitch, shawty suckin' on my dick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.690" end="02:01.360">Got my finger on the trigger, you ain't even hear the click</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.360" end="02:05.360" /></div></body></tt>